{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110085","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110085/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110085/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110085/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110085","id":3366645918,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7IqvCe","number":110085,"title":"Forward Mobile: When lights have distant faders set, close lights can be disabled due to max lights hard limit.","user":{"login":"Rinnegatamante","id":9152710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNTI3MTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9152710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante","html_url":"https://github.com/Rinnegatamante","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinnegatamante/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-08-29T12:06:29Z","updated_at":"2025-09-02T20:27:02Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.3.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - Forward Mobile\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen more than 8 omnilights or spotlights do affect a single mesh in Forward Mobile renderer and all the lights have distant faders set up, the first 8 lights to be enabled by the faders will be the one that will get sent to the mesh. This is a problem when distant faders are used to selectively disable distant lights in favor of enabling close ones since the close ones can eventually be nots ent to the mesh.\n\nA possible solution would be to sort lights by distance (the very distance the distant faders use to calculate when to enable/disable lights) prior sending them as candidates for a mesh draw.\n\nHere's a small video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5324d0cf-709e-478a-875b-e03e5e843a1f\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nIn order to reproduce the issue with the sample project, just move around the camera like in the video.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[lights.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22044861/lights.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110085/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110085/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}